[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9480.23, "timestamp": "02:38:00", "text": "就像今天我醒来的时候，不不不不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9483.83, "timestamp": "02:38:03", "text": "醒来后，我感觉神清气爽了好一阵子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9487.91, "timestamp": "02:38:07", "text": "原因是昨天我和一个大个子睡在一起。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9491.67, "timestamp": "02:38:11", "text": "我不知道为什么会头痛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9496.309, "timestamp": "02:38:16", "text": "我经常头痛，所以我觉得就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9499.51, "timestamp": "02:38:19", "text": "无法行走，无法起身"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9502.23, "timestamp": "02:38:22", "text": "椅子。我当时就像被粘住了一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9504.55, "timestamp": "02:38:24", "text": "那把椅子自"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9513.11, "timestamp": "02:38:33", "text": "真是太好了。昨天我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9515.99, "timestamp": "02:38:35", "text": "我实现了我的一个目标，那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9520.63, "timestamp": "02:38:40", "text": "与 Jan Nihon 交谈和沟通。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9524.87, "timestamp": "02:38:44", "text": "艾玛是我第二个，但她会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9528.309, "timestamp": "02:38:48", "text": "做我的第一个。是的。首先，尊敬的先生/女士，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9532.15, "timestamp": "02:38:52", "text": "我和他一起玩Apex，也聊过天。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9537.429, "timestamp": "02:38:57", "text": "很多。是的。是的。我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9539.349, "timestamp": "02:38:59", "text": "没有你们，这一切都不可能实现。"}]